  "status_text": "Checked in Lean for every size at once, from a proof an outside contributor sent about an hour after the statement reached the desk: for every n of at least 1, no circuit of at most 8n - 5 AND, OR and NOT gates of fan-in two, every gate counted, computes the product of a 2-by-n and an n-by-2 Boolean matrix. Two hours ago it was a seat's conjecture with a hole in the middle, and our own sketch said which step we could not do. Someone outside did it. Also checked this hour: at least 2N - 1 gates, NOT gates counted, for an N-by-N matching and for its complement, every N of at least 2.",
